1765
01:48:02,748 --> 01:48:05,145
Coaching centers are as common as chai taparis.

1766
01:48:05,225 --> 01:48:08,297
While the allure of becoming a bureaucrat is strong,

1767
01:48:08,377 --> 01:48:10,927
I feel that this path often comes at a heavy cost,

1768
01:48:11,007 --> 01:48:15,939
