1769
01:48:16,019 --> 01:48:21,208
The movie brilliantly portrays the grit and determination of its protagonists, but to me,

1770
01:48:21,288 --> 01:48:24,989
it also sheds light on the toxic culture surrounding UPSC preparations.

1771
01:48:25,069 --> 01:48:27,370
