1776
01:48:39,215 --> 01:48:45,109
unable to transition to other careers because they have invested everything into a system that rarely gives back.

1777
01:48:45,189 --> 01:48:53,014
The narrative pushed by coaching centers and society glorifies the UPSC struggle to the point that it almost becomes an identity.

1778
01:48:53,094 --> 01:48:54,870
I believe that this romanticization

1779
01:48:55,210 --> 01:48:55,781
is damaging,

1780
01:48:55,861 --> 01:48:59,530
why aren't we questioning the efficiency of a system where such a large majority fail?

1781
01:48:59,610 --> 01:49:00,110
Bureaucracy, while important, shouldn't be the only yardstick to success in India.

1782
01:49:00,689 --> 01:49:02,970
